{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01116",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 4.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Okay, good morning, grab a seat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.09,
      "end_seconds": 7.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.62,
      "end_seconds": 11.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.66,
      "end_seconds": 18.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them. How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 20.3,
      "end_seconds": 26.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Let me think, we came because of a dry cough in the evenings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.0,
      "end_seconds": 30.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.08,
      "end_seconds": 46.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.5,
      "end_seconds": 78.91,
      "duration_seconds": 15.41,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, blood pressure 116 over 79, respiratory rate 18, pulse is 76 beats a minute. Okay, how long has it been like this? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.41,
      "end_seconds": 92.26,
      "duration_seconds": 11.85,
      "text": "It's been about a week, I'm fairly sure. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.23,
      "end_seconds": 96.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Is there something that settles it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.98,
      "end_seconds": 102.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Erm, only antihistamine, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.04,
      "end_seconds": 106.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Is anything making it worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.7,
      "end_seconds": 113.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, yes, pollen season. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.65,
      "end_seconds": 118.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "What about itchy eyes, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.0,
      "end_seconds": 135.53,
      "duration_seconds": 15.53,
      "text": "Yes, I have. As for itchy eyes, it happens every other day. Oh, uh, and sneezing fits. That's been about the same, two months. About sneezing fits, I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.6,
      "end_seconds": 143.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Did you get wheeze, fever or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.65,
      "end_seconds": 148.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Right, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.74,
      "end_seconds": 151.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.74,
      "end_seconds": 155.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.52,
      "end_seconds": 162.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.79,
      "end_seconds": 168.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "I mean, um, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.25,
      "end_seconds": 187.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.57,
      "end_seconds": 191.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.16,
      "end_seconds": 196.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "So, what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.6,
      "end_seconds": 204.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Just my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.69,
      "end_seconds": 207.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.85,
      "end_seconds": 212.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.47,
      "end_seconds": 215.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.17,
      "end_seconds": 221.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.13,
      "end_seconds": 224.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.29,
      "end_seconds": 229.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.48,
      "end_seconds": 235.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Alright, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 237.21,
      "end_seconds": 255.56,
      "duration_seconds": 18.35,
      "text": "Right, um, she is on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety, I give it to her. Okay, uh, so she takes iron tablets, once a day. Well, it's loratadine, 10 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.15,
      "end_seconds": 258.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.81,
      "end_seconds": 265.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Anxiety, for about a year. I've got low haemoglobin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.89,
      "end_seconds": 273.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Okay, I can see anxiety in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.8,
      "end_seconds": 278.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.78,
      "end_seconds": 290.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.16,
      "end_seconds": 295.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.23,
      "end_seconds": 314.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your nose looks a little swollen inside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.0,
      "end_seconds": 320.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.75,
      "end_seconds": 352.36,
      "duration_seconds": 16.61,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards seasonal hay fever causing the cough. Let's use fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, for the season. It's for hay fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.63,
      "end_seconds": 359.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Should I take that with food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.09,
      "end_seconds": 365.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.48,
      "end_seconds": 372.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Come back or go to emergency straight away if you start wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.5,
      "end_seconds": 375.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.53,
      "end_seconds": 379.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.2,
      "end_seconds": 384.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Actually, thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.16,
      "end_seconds": 386.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}